message:
fix(sdk): surface gateway responses from admin/domains/secrets/functions/sender-domain delete-style methods (#221 cross-namespace)

Promise<void> on these methods threw away meaningful gateway responses.
Each method now returns the actual envelope from the gateway:

- admin.sendMessage: { status: "sent" }
- domains.remove:    { status: "deleted", domain }
- secrets.delete:    { status: "deleted", key }
- functions.delete:  { status: "deleted", name }
